    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not your typical precision platformer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Academy: Become a Hero</i> is a challenging platformer that goes beyond abstract and frantic environments. Instead, it immerses you in an academy where future Heroes train to overcome obstacle courses and develop extraordinary skills. Each trial will test your dexterity, reflexes, and ability to adapt. Can you complete every challenge before time runs out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging training in an immersive world</strong> \u2013 Face circuits designed as elite training within a hero academy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based races</strong> \u2013 Complete each course before time runs out. Every second counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong> \u2013 Master moves like the double jump, dash, and wall jump, inspired by platforming classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story</strong> \u2013 Discover the path to becoming a Hero as you progress through the academy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become a Hero? Prove your worth in <i>Academy: Become a Hero</i>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not your typical precision platformer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Academy: Become a Hero</i> is a challenging platformer that goes beyond abstract and frantic environments. Instead, it immerses you in an academy where future Heroes train to overcome obstacle courses and develop extraordinary skills. Each trial will test your dexterity, reflexes, and ability to adapt. Can you complete every challenge before time runs out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging training in an immersive world</strong> \u2013 Face circuits designed as elite training within a hero academy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based races</strong> \u2013 Complete each course before time runs out. Every second counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities</strong> \u2013 Master moves like the double jump, dash, and wall jump, inspired by platforming classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story</strong> \u2013 Discover the path to becoming a Hero as you progress through the academy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become a Hero? Prove your worth in <i>Academy: Become a Hero</i>!</p>",
